help kill
kill [-<signal>] <pid> ...

  Sends a signal a set of processes, identified by pid #. The pid #
can be determined by the ps command. Some of the standard process
signals are:

#   Name    Description

1   KILL    Kill process. Cannot be masked or trapped.
6   ABRT    Abort process.
7   INT     Interrupt process.
9   HUP     Hang up process. Sent when parent process terminates.
12  RPWR    Robot power fail.

